{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把起初的感受概括成轻松，偏向了真正获得自由后的放松。完整稿实际强调的是强撑着挺直背脊、不能倒下却很想停下来，随后还有胸口发紧和空落感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把没走又会怎样具体解释成如果没有离开就仍会受到伤害。完整稿只是反复追问另一种选择会怎样，并没有断言留下就一定会继续受伤。其余亲近回忆、委屈翻涌和选择怀疑都拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"没有明显拼错具体事件，但遗漏了怕独自承担未来难事这一重要感受。完整稿呈现的是一边害怕，一边仍然向前，不收回自己的打算，而不只是清醒、克制和坚定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把最终感受概括为平静，显得过于彻底。完整稿仍保留了想起过去时的心软，以及对未来孤单的担忧；只是决定不因陪伴而回头，并非已经没有情绪波动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把不再较劲扩展成不再执着于过去的人和关系，原文并没有明确说已经放下旧关系。另外，结尾并非完全释然，仍有对等待漫长的担忧和尚未消失的不安，只是同时获得了继续生活的力量。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"两者讲述的是同一个故事：一个人离开后，在怀念旧日亲近与不愿再忍受委屈之间反复挣扎，最终不靠回头换取陪伴，而是带着想念和伤继续把自己的生活过好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "318befb9-65dd-4e98-9d43-36121f60d116", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T132351660784Z", "elapsed_seconds": 180.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T13:26:52.458631+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3b1506f63b121b0b9e4548293e2f242f65a93aa7e52938c432126c6a0b10060b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T132351660784Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b33459bdf1b7dfa48555420b5887378387363debd969fb2fe8fd7343c6f18838"}}}
